-- Migration: 056_compact_districts
-- Purpose: founder feedback pass 2 - Lien Chieu and Hoa Vang sprawled into the
-- highlands (the 2025 wards absorbed the former rural communes), and the FPT
-- City quarter needed to be visible again. Lien Chieu is now its own ward
-- polygon, Hoa Vang drops the Ba Na mountain ring, and fpt-city returns as a
-- focused quarter polygon that is SUBTRACTED from Ngu Hanh Son so the two
-- never overlap.

